<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="TVM5.10.2">
<l>vatuvai vārttaiyu ḷēṟu pāyntatu māya māviṉai vāypi ḷantatu</l>
<l>matuvaivār kuḻalār kuravai piṇainta kuḻaku</l>
<l>matuvitu vutuveṉṉa lāvaṉa valla veṉṉaiyuṉ ceykai naivikku</l>
<l>mutuvaiya mutalvāvuṉṉai yeṉṟu talaip peyvaṉē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Leaping at the bulls in the wedding business, tearing the mouth of the wondrous horse,</l>
<l>[your] youth in which you entwined in the Kuravai dance with [girls with] curls in which honey is put [and] flows</l>
<l>– o first one in the ancient world</l>
<l>whose actions wound me strongly that are to be called that, this [and] that,</l>
	<l>when shall I meet you?</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
